# AI Platform

A production-style AI Platform built on Kubernetes.

## Objective

Build a modern AI Infrastructure platform capable of serving Large Language Models using Kubernetes, GitOps and Infrastructure as Code.

## Technology Stack

- Kubernetes (k3s)
- Helm
- ArgoCD
- Prometheus
- Grafana
- Ollama
- Open WebUI
- Qwen
- DeepSeek
- Terraform
- GitHub Actions

## Project Status

- [x] k3s
- [x] Traefik
- [x] ArgoCD
- [ ] GitOps Repository
- [ ] Monitoring
- [ ] AI Serving
- [ ] CI/CD
- [ ] Infrastructure as Code